FastFsi

FastFsi implements methods from the literature and from the open-source projects below. No source code of these
projects is included; their notices are reproduced to credit the referenced algorithms.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IBAMR  https://github.com/IBAMR/IBAMR  (BSD 3-Clause License)

Referenced in fastfsi.coupling and fastfsi.solid: the IB_4 and IB_3 regularized delta kernels of IBTK; explicit
immersed-boundary time stepping (IBExplicitHierarchyIntegrator) and its midpoint rule (MIDPOINT_RULE); the
side-centred interpolation and spreading of LEInteractor; the penalty method for an immersed boundary with mass
(PenaltyIBMethod, after Kim & Peskin 2007); target-point and penalty forces (IBStandardForceGen, IBFE).

IBAMR: An adaptive and distributed-memory parallel implementation of
